      "id": "claim_f18c3bb96f374647bf847f9d86cf387a",
      "statement": "The --x integration shells out from Node to the headless Grok agent binary (grok) to run the /whathappened skill with native X tools (x_keyword_search, x_semantic_search, x_thread_fetch, x_user_search) and returns a structured X signal; it requires Grok Build auth plus native X tools on the grok binary, not XAI_API_KEY or OPENROUTER_API_KEY.",
